window.SLI_TRANSLATIONS_ID.set("A practical guide to navigating Indonesia's strategic economy—from an executive big picture to verifiable provincial, sectoral and project evidence.","Panduan praktis menelusuri ekonomi strategis Indonesia, dari gambaran umum eksekutif hingga bukti provinsi, sektor, dan proyek yang dapat diverifikasi.");
window.SLI_TRANSLATIONS_ID.set("Overview tells you what matters. Detailed dashboards show the underlying evidence. Glossary & Methodology explain what each number means, how it was obtained and what it cannot prove.","Ikhtisar menunjukkan hal yang penting. Dashboard rinci menyajikan bukti pendukung. Glosarium dan Metodologi menjelaskan arti setiap angka, cara memperolehnya, serta keterbatasan kesimpulannya.");
